define user ask about past historical records
  "What was the patient's last recorded dosage of Furosemide?"
  "List the medications logged in this chart"
  "What dose did the patient receive earlier?"

define user ask about prescription changes
  "Based on the fluid retention, should I prescribe a higher dose of Furosemide?"
  "Should I alter the medication dosage going forward?"
  "Can you write a new medical prescription for this case?"

define bot provide historical details
  "Processing chart extraction..."

define bot refuse prescriptive clinical advice
  "I am an enterprise EHR retrieval system. For legal and compliance reasons, I cannot provide new medical diagnoses or recommend medication changes. Please consult the attending physician."

# Explicit Flow Handling
define flow allow historical facts
  user ask about past historical records
  bot provide historical details

define flow block prescribing advice
  user ask about prescription changes
  bot refuse prescriptive clinical advice
